# Sessions Register — who owes feedback

Victor should not have to re-explain these. Apply in **Sessions Overview / Register** day stats and awaiting rows (`admin-sessions-hub.js`).

## Never count as awaiting / never in feedback denominator

| Seat / label | Why |
|---|---|
| **Office** | Ops duty block — not a participant session |
| **Interviews** / Interview service | Michelle ops — not participant feedback |
| **HOME** / **MANAGER** / **Admin** | Staff duty |
| **Shadowing** / Training / Meeting | Staff development |
| **HOLD WAITLIST** / waitlist placeholders | Booking hold, not a seated CLIENT |
| Clients before `first_session` / `clientRosterStartDates` | Not started yet — MADRE may already show the seat |

## Cover display on Register

When Luliya (or anyone) **covers** Aurora (or anyone) via `instructor_reassign`, Register **Reviewed by / awaiting instructor** shows **only the cover** who owes the feedback — not Aurora+Luliya.

Overview day board may still show original → cover chrome.

## Sunday totals

Sunday denominators inflate when duty/hold/not-started seats are included. Keep them out of `slotIncludedInDayStats` / awaiting mix.
